OL,3,GNEWSAThree people injured in police
OL,4,Avehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people including two police
OL,7,Fofficers have been injured in a crash
OL,8,Finvolving a car and a police vehicle
OL,9,Fresponding to an emergency incident.
OL,11,FThe crash happened on St Mary's Road in
OL,12,FMoston, Manchester, at about 10:35 BST
OL,13,Fon Tuesday, Greater Manchester Police
OL,14,F(GMP) said.
OL,16,FA GMP spokesperson said the driver of
OL,17,Fthe car and two officers from the
OL,18,Fpolice vehicle sustained injuries and
OL,19,Fwere taken to hospital as a
OL,20,Fprecautionary measure.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
